-Sessions never expire.
+## Session expiry
+
+Each saved session records an `issued_at` timestamp. Sessions expire after
+`SESSION_TTL` (3600 seconds, defined in `sessionsvc.store`): `load_session` raises
+`SessionExpiredError` for a blob older than the TTL (or malformed), and calls
+`purge_expired()` to delete expired entries from the on-disk cache.
+
+Blobs and cache entries are JSON, not pickle, so they must contain JSON-serializable data.
